        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Ghost Shock&quot; is an asymmetric single-player action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning of the battle, the player controls a hero with extraordinary power. After being defeated, he will randomly turn into a monster, and the monster that gets the last blow will turn into a hero and continue to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, the player will challenge the boss controlled by three ghosts, or control the boss with two ghosts to meet the challenge of the hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Death is not the end]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The death of the hero does not mean the end of the game. The ghost who defeats the hero will be reborn and transformed into a new hero. The defeated hero will become a soul servant controlled by the demon until he defeats the hero and resurrects again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Equipment Matching]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hero can collect teeth as trophies to buy more powerful equipment and skills. Match a variety of weapons, equipment and skills to build different combat styles. You can choose to use long-range skills for continuous consumption, or use sharp melee attacks to defeat the enemy. The strategy and style of the battle depends entirely on your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Monster Evolution]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loyal servants can receive the gift of the demon. Monsters can consume psychic energy and choose to evolve into one of two new forms, using more powerful dark forces to easily defeat the hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Boss Battle】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a victory condition for the game, the hero will challenge the boss controlled by three ghosts. If the hero can successfully defeat the boss in three challenge opportunities, he will win the game. On the contrary, if the hero unfortunately loses in the third challenge, the three ghosts will win together.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Ghost Shock&quot; is an asymmetric single-player action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning of the battle, the player controls a hero with extraordinary power. After being defeated, he will randomly turn into a monster, and the monster that gets the last blow will turn into a hero and continue to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, the player will challenge the boss controlled by three ghosts, or control the boss with two ghosts to meet the challenge of the hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Death is not the end]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The death of the hero does not mean the end of the game. The ghost who defeats the hero will be reborn and transformed into a new hero. The defeated hero will become a soul servant controlled by the demon until he defeats the hero and resurrects again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Equipment Matching]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hero can collect teeth as trophies to buy more powerful equipment and skills. Match a variety of weapons, equipment and skills to build different combat styles. You can choose to use long-range skills for continuous consumption, or use sharp melee attacks to defeat the enemy. The strategy and style of the battle depends entirely on your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Monster Evolution]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loyal servants can receive the gift of the demon. Monsters can consume psychic energy and choose to evolve into one of two new forms, using more powerful dark forces to easily defeat the hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Boss Battle】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a victory condition for the game, the hero will challenge the boss controlled by three ghosts. If the hero can successfully defeat the boss in three challenge opportunities, he will win the game. On the contrary, if the hero unfortunately loses in the third challenge, the three ghosts will win together.</p>",
        "short_description": "Switch roles between heroes and monsters to fight, become the embodiment of justice or let evil rule, everything is possible.",
